WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:18.660
I — have worn too many names.

2
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:26.645
Tried to find the one that fits.

3
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:29.307
Identified myself by what I've done.

4
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:34.630
Cared what the world thinks.

5
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:50.600
Afraid to come up empty.

6
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.920
Afraid to leave no mark.

7
00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:00.140
Traded everything I was.

8
00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:06.680
Trying to find out who I am.

9
00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:13.320
But in the garden in the dark.

10
00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:20.260
He — didn't come to teach or speak.

11
00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:29.000
Christ — measured the full weight of me.

12
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:35.640
Every sorrow, every dream.

13
00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:43.300
Every shame I've carried quietly.

14
00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:49.620
Every hope I couldn't name.

15
00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:57.780
He felt it all from the inside.

16
00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:02.780
And — He didn't turn away.

17
00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:07.300
You always knew me.

18
00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:10.840
Before I knew myself.

19
00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:17.420
You didn't wait for me to find you.

20
00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:24.840
You came to know me first, earn my trust.

21
00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:28.920
I am a child of God.

22
00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:31.800
That's who I've always been.

23
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.320
I don't have to search anymore.

24
00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.700
I'm already known.

25
00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:43.080
I'm already loved.

26
00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:48.740
I've found my heavenly home.

27
00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:58.500
He — didn't stay dead, He lives

28
00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:05.480
That's the thing that makes it real.

29
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:13.820
He — rose and works among the faithful still.

30
00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.720
Not a memory.

31
00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:20.280
Not just an ideal.

32
00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:27.960
All that time I spent on fear.

33
00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:32.980
All that searching, all that weight.

34
00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:42.820
Now I set it free — and I'll use it well.

35
00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:49.680
On something worth my days.

36
00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:53.120
Not just a teacher.

37
00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:56.440
Not just a death.

38
00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:03.400
He used the power of Creation.

39
00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:06.640
To know me first.

40
00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:11.980
And knowing me completely.

41
00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:17.060
He thought I was worth His life.

42
00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:23.080
He thought you were worth it, too.

43
00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:27.880
He still does.

44
00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.680
You always knew me.

45
00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:38.220
Before I knew myself.

46
00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:44.960
You didn't wait for me to find you.

47
00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:52.320
You came to know me first, earn my trust.

48
00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:59.360
I am a child of God, and so are you.

49
00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.880
You don't have to search anymore.

50
00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:06.120
You're already known.

51
00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:10.660
You're already loved.

52
00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.940
Welcome home...

53
00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:27.620
The search is over it was always over.

54
00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:33.100
He just wanted you to know.

55
00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:39.860
In the name of Jesus Christ.

56
00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.980
Amen.
